    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d790">

                <pb facs="0750" n="634" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg634"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 894.001 M98/9.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Emperor</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>On the sad occasion of the death of His Majesty the Emperor Mutsuhito, your
                    illustrious father, I offer to Your Majesty my most profound sympathy and that
                    of the Government and people of the United States.</p>
                <p>Accept my good wishes for a long and prosperous reign and the continuance of the
                    welfare of the Japanese Empire.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
